# Scratch queue rows RPS (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/RPS.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-RPS Raspberry Pie standalone, isolation tests, 2026-11-21 ([plan_rp_standalone.md](../plan_rp_standalone.md) section 6, TODO `food-tuning #38` to `#46`)
@@date 2026-11-21
@@jars solraspberrypie
@@sources feature_writeup/plan_rp_standalone.md development/solRaspberryPie
@@modset rps only
@@text
@@text Not run. Targets the final `solRaspberryPie` jar after plan phases P1 to P6 and P8 (nests Apple Pie 2.2.0 and Carrot
@@text 1.14.0). Jar set `tools/scratch_query/modsets/rps.toml`: Forge plus the Raspberry Pie jar only, no KubeJS, no Creative
@@text jars, empty `config/` and `defaultconfigs/` (the mod runs on its built-in defaults). Variants: `rps only` (default),
@@text `rps loose` (adds a loose `solapplepie-1.19.2-2.2.0.jar`, kept in `jar_archive/displaced/`), `rps alex` (adds Alex's
@@text Mobs 1.21.1 and Citadel). Default ladder (P2, owner rulings 2026-11-21): Apple Pie's ladder halved to a top of 50
@@text (16 half-heart rungs 2.5 to 50, toughness at 7.5, 25, 40, knockback at 20, its flat effects at 1 to 50), 10 vanilla
@@text unlocks at 5, 8.8, 12.8, 17.1, 21.5, 26.3, 31.4, 36.9, 43, 50 (2026-11-22, PR-RP-11), 4 effect slots at 5, 15, 27.5,
@@text 40; start line `Diet ladder: 44 rungs, 4 slots, 8 pool effects`, no warning (V12 included). Client rows
@@text (CQ) need a fresh survival world with that jar set. The existing Raspberry Pie rows (SQ-RPI, CQ-RPI in
@@text [RP.qb](RP.qb) section 2) are rerun against the final jar after these pass (plan section 6, TODO `food-tuning #46`).
@@text
@@text Client rows (CQ-RPS-02, -03, -05, -09, -14, -15 and section 9's CQ-RPS-12, steps r1124gate) run as `qrun.py pair`: the
@@text capture driver needs Creative Devtools and Creative Common (so KubeJS, Rhino, Architectury) on the client, and a joined
@@text client must carry the server's mod list, so each row's `@modset` adds those five jars to `rps only` (empty config,
@@text probe-only kubejs; build OUT with `qmodset.py build OUT LEVEL B SPEC`) and the client drops every other jar:
@@text `mapfile -t J < <(cd mods && ls *.jar | grep -vE '^(solRaspberryPie|creativecommon|creativedevtools|kubejs-forge|rhino-forge|architectury)-' | sed 's/[][*?]/?/g'); D=(); for j in "${J[@]}"; do D+=(--drop "$j"); done`
@@text then `qrun.py pair OUT GAME feature_writeup/testing/rows/RPS.qb RES --rows IDS "${D[@]}" --config config/solraspberrypie-client.toml:dietLog:extraWidth='"x"'`
@@text (`?` for the glob characters some jar names hold; the extraWidth value is for CQ-RPS-15: a wrong-typed value is corrected to the jar default 48 at load, whereas an out-of-range int such as -1 is clamped to the range bound 0).
@@text Commands go to the server console with `@a` (one player); `cli> solrp diversity get @s` replies in the client's chat
@@text (`[CHAT]` lines) after `op @a`. The client keeps the pack's client tomls (icon lists fall back to their vanilla entries).
@@text
@@table
## SQ-RPS-01 | isolated boot: ladder loads clean, nested mods found
@group B
@commands Boot with `rps only`. `grep -nE "Diet ladder|Raspberry Pie|solapplepie|solcarrot|Mixin apply|Missing or unsupported" logs/latest.log` (RPS-01)
@pass exactly one `Diet ladder: 44 rungs, 4 slots, 8 pool effects` info line; no `Diet ladder (` warning line (V12 included); no `APPLE PIE SETTINGS RASPBERRY PIE CANNOT WORK WITH` block; no missing-dependency, mixin or injection error; `Done (` reached
@fails nested jar metadata or version range in `mods.toml` / `ce.forge-bundle.gradle` (P1); default ladder file (P2); a mixin target that needs a mod the standalone set lacks (P4, P6)
@from plan_rp_standalone.md section 6
bootexpect Diet ladder: 44 rungs, 4 slots, 8 pool effects
bootreject Diet ladder \(
bootreject APPLE PIE SETTINGS RASPBERRY PIE CANNOT WORK WITH
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|InvalidInjectionException|Mixin apply.*solraspberrypie.*failed|MixinApplyError|Encountered an unexpected exception
look the `Diet ladder:` line appears once in the whole log (grep -c); the line reads exactly `Diet ladder: 44 rungs, 4 slots, 8 pool effects`
## CQ-RPS-02 | isolated client: names, Apple Pie book and potato recipe gone, book recipes work
@group client
@commands Client with `rps only`, new survival world. Inventory, `/recipe`-free: open the crafting table and JEI-free recipe book; craft book + bread, book + apple juice or any drink, book + carrot (RPS-02)
@pass the book is named Diet Log, the second book Food Dictionary (not Apple Pie's names); Apple Pie's own book recipe and its potato recipe are absent; book + food gives a Diet Log, book + drink a Liquid Diet Log
@fails Raspberry Pie `assets/solraspberrypie/lang/en_us.json` and `client/LangOverrides.java` (names, P4: the lang file holds `solraspberrypie.override.item.solapplepie.food_book` "Diet Log", `solraspberrypie.override.item.solcarrot.food_book` "Food Dictionary", `solraspberrypie.override.key.solapplepie.open_food_book` "Open Diet Log"; `client.ClientLanguageMixin` copies each `solraspberrypie.override.<key>` onto `<key>` after all lang files merge, so Controls also shows "Open Diet Log"); `RecipeManagerMixin` (recipe removal must run without KubeJS)
@reviewed 2026-11-24
@modset rps only +"creativecommon-*" +"creativedevtools-*" +"kubejs-forge-*" +"rhino-forge-*" +"architectury-*"
